mera stops, the parser may have already processed all objects up to camera+lookahead. So no reads.\n\nAlternative: trace_writes read on $A690 while the game is at the very start (camera 0) right after load, because the initial load parses the first page(s). Let me test: reset -> start 1-1 -> trace imme","truncated":true}
